<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46-3/8 (FIM 210.75).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46-3/8 (FIM 210.75).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1 at $46-3/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 210.75 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 1.80 markka at 209.40.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/8 at $30-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 69.02 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.30 markka at 69.20.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18 on Thursday. The price equals about 81.80 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed unchanged at 83.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
